{
  "name": "claude-say-framework",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Sparrived",
  "description": "ClaudeSay 视频制作框架：Clawd（Claude Code 的橙色像素小人）当讲解员、纯代码编写与渲染的讲解动画 —— GSAP 时间轴 + KaTeX + D3 + Web Audio 配乐，Puppeteer + FFmpeg 导出 MP4",
